OL,3,GNEWSABurst main leaves homes without
OL,4,Awater for 14 hours
OL,5,
OL,6,FA spokesperson for South West Water,
OL,7,Fwhich owns and operates Bristol Water,
OL,8,Fsaid its team was working to fix the
OL,9,Fissue as quickly as possible. They said
OL,10,Fa bottled water hub at Tesco Superstore
OL,11,Fin Paulton would be open to the public
OL,12,Ffrom 15:30 GMT.
